{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1542931200, "end_date": 1543622399, "month_true_total": 11813, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:58:14 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "47220100", "author": {"steamid": "76561198335102715", "personaname": "N/A", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198335102715/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 98, "playtime_forever": 28283, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 639, "last_played": 1766045001, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just Amazing.", "timestamp_created": 1543620755, "timestamp_updated": 1543620755, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "47219623", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056915190", "personaname": "Battle-Brother Antonius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/battlebrotherantonius/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 163309, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 91673, "last_played": 1757953437, "avatar": "f715e8b796676a7c2b4b8508700b0a311b90f709"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's okay, I guess", "timestamp_created": 1543618826, "timestamp_updated": 1543618826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516129016876220703", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47219525", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036004515", "personaname": "Austin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mozinqo/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 188182, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 103462, "last_played": 1750785825, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played my fair share of Warframe and I've enjoyed every second of it. Not only is it one of my top 5 favorite games of all time, it's entirely free. I've always been the type to enjoy games that involved 1) a lot of customization where I can show off to others my accomplishments in-game, 2) games that involved grinding where my time investment felt meaningful and rewarding, and 3) games that involved theorycrafting and builds. Warframe is one of the only games I've ever found that checks all 3 boxes. \n\nThe sad part is that I think I'm finally burnt out and will be looking for other games to sink my time into. The insanely good part is that burn out came after years of playing and 1800 hours spent in the game. The only other game that I've spent close to that amount of time in is WoW (of which I have about 3000 hours played in) and it costs money for each expansion AND $15 a month.\n\nIf you haven't played it, just play it. It's well worth the $0 entrance fee, that's for sure.", "timestamp_created": 1543618459, "timestamp_updated": 1556225296, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47217899", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084752607", "personaname": "DUSTY6277", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DUSTY6277/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playt